# oracle: compute body/local with one keyword (type, a local vector) on the four cut-down 2d nparticle bodies of w152body_local_nparticle (setup only, run 0): the vector (one type per sub-particle, rows in atom order) is written by dump local and compared token by token; thermo pe ke etotal
# Measured max relative error: 5e-9 for the local vector (native dump local prints 8 significant digits, every printed value matches the engine exactly; the file check is filerel=1e-14 with abs 1e-12) and thermo within rel 1e-9.
# oracle-inputs: w152body_local_nparticle.data
# oracle-files: w152body_local_vector.dump
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12 filerel=1e-14
units           lj
dimension       2
atom_style      body nparticle 2 6
atom_modify     sort 0 0.0
read_data       w152body_local_nparticle.data
velocity        all create 1.44 87287 loop geom
pair_style      body/nparticle 5.0
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
neighbor        0.5 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix             1 all nve/body
fix             2 all enforce2d
compute         1 all body/local type
dump            1 all local 1 w152body_local_vector.dump index c_1
thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          1
run             0
